# Pairs with RMonotonicVisibility. The receiver's post-gate fan-out consumes a
# committed bucket without materialising it. Before the fan-out the key is
# served post-saga through the gate (a pending bucket under a committed
# registry); afterwards the bucket is gone and the projection never received
# the write, so the same key is served pre-saga.
MODULE: RMonotonicVisibilityFanOutDiscardsCommittedBucket
TARGET: RMonotonicVisibility
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the receiver fan-out drops a committed bucket without draining it into the projection
PERTURBS: ReceiverFanOut

--- FIND
            /\ rproj' = IF rdec[TreeOf(k)] = "committed" /\ rpend[k] = "pending"
                        THEN [rproj EXCEPT ![k] = "post"]
                        ELSE rproj
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the commit discards the bucket instead of draining it.
            /\ rproj' = rproj
--- END
